WEBVTT

00:01:52.730 --> 00:01:53.690
Rain...

00:01:54.820 --> 00:01:56.570
Little girl!

00:01:57.980 --> 00:01:59.610
Erin-chan!

00:02:00.840 --> 00:02:03.400
Esal-sensei is calling for you.

00:02:03.400 --> 00:02:05.830
She wants you right away.

00:02:10.920 --> 00:02:16.820
Death of Jone

00:02:19.770 --> 00:02:21.530
Excuse me.

00:02:21.530 --> 00:02:23.610
Of course, come in.

00:02:49.170 --> 00:02:51.150
Erin, read this.

00:02:55.740 --> 00:02:57.580
Tousana Asan?

00:02:59.390 --> 00:03:01.730
That's Jone Oji-san's son.

00:03:02.140 --> 00:03:03.190
That's right.

00:03:07.760 --> 00:03:14.820
"Early yesterday morning my father, Tousana Jone, passed away...

00:03:15.530 --> 00:03:18.280
due to heart disease..."

00:03:24.520 --> 00:03:26.330
It's a very short letter, isn't it?

00:03:27.110 --> 00:03:30.230
It relays the bare minimum of information.

00:03:32.110 --> 00:03:34.450
He's such a heartless son.

00:03:36.540 --> 00:03:37.830
Keep strong.

00:03:40.890 --> 00:03:45.210
I have... only been thinking of Lilan this whole time...

00:03:46.190 --> 00:03:48.830
I didn't even go see him during the summer break...

00:03:49.350 --> 00:03:50.410
I'm...

00:03:51.130 --> 00:03:56.420
Erin, Jone wished for you to pursue academics here.

00:03:57.720 --> 00:03:58.930
Take a look.

00:03:59.340 --> 00:04:02.350
Jone left these to you.

00:04:06.360 --> 00:04:07.780
It's very like him, isn't it?

00:04:11.790 --> 00:04:16.840
These are all the books he read to me.

00:04:18.000 --> 00:04:22.420
He would clarify the words I couldn't read or materials that were hard to understand...

00:04:32.120 --> 00:04:34.120
Stop crying, Mokku.

00:04:37.910 --> 00:04:40.410
But...  Occhan has...

00:04:41.110 --> 00:04:44.980
It's much harder on the little girl than you!

00:04:50.190 --> 00:04:51.790
Nukku-san, Mokku-san.

00:04:51.790 --> 00:04:53.990
Thank you for carrying the books for me.

00:04:54.640 --> 00:04:56.770
Anything for you.

00:04:56.770 --> 00:04:58.420
I'm the one who carried them!

00:04:58.420 --> 00:04:59.880
Shut up!

00:04:59.880 --> 00:05:01.360
It's true!

00:05:01.360 --> 00:05:04.920
You only wanted to act cool in front of her!

00:05:13.680 --> 00:05:14.650
Ani.

00:05:15.140 --> 00:05:16.980
Mokku.

00:05:36.610 --> 00:05:39.920
<i>All right, I'll teach you properly about bees.</i>

00:05:42.440 --> 00:05:45.100
<i>I can even make harps.</i>

00:06:07.610 --> 00:06:09.340
Hold on, Lilan!

00:06:34.180 --> 00:06:35.430
Should we go back?

00:06:37.740 --> 00:06:39.330
Esal-sensei?

00:06:40.230 --> 00:06:42.840
Esal-sensei, is there something wrong?

00:06:43.950 --> 00:06:45.700
Do you need me?

00:06:47.750 --> 00:06:49.070
Um...

00:06:50.260 --> 00:06:51.610
No, ah...

00:06:52.120 --> 00:06:54.570
Right.  Is everything okay with Lilan?

00:06:54.930 --> 00:06:56.870
Yes.  She's doing well.

00:06:57.340 --> 00:06:58.210
I see.

00:07:00.480 --> 00:07:04.160
Esal-sensei.  I'm all right now.

00:07:06.130 --> 00:07:09.660
But... why don't you take some time off from Lilan?

00:07:10.190 --> 00:07:11.660
I can assign a replacement.

00:07:11.930 --> 00:07:13.790
No, I'll be fine.

00:07:15.780 --> 00:07:17.330
Let's go, Lilan!

00:07:45.420 --> 00:07:46.370
Erin?

00:07:47.360 --> 00:07:49.130
How have you been?

00:07:49.130 --> 00:07:50.680
Tomura-senpai.

00:07:51.110 --> 00:07:52.280
I'm back.

00:07:55.860 --> 00:07:59.930
You don't have anything to say after all these days away?

00:07:59.930 --> 00:08:02.010
Nothing like, "welcome back?"

00:08:03.010 --> 00:08:04.000
I'm sorry!

00:08:04.280 --> 00:08:06.420
It was summer break, wasn't it?

00:08:07.740 --> 00:08:09.200
Oh, right.

00:08:09.200 --> 00:08:10.890
I got you a souvenir.

00:08:12.270 --> 00:08:12.960
There.

00:08:15.730 --> 00:08:17.820
A sculpture of a beast-lord?

00:08:18.470 --> 00:08:21.780
My hometown's known for high-quality woods.

00:08:22.350 --> 00:08:23.700
Really?

00:08:24.370 --> 00:08:27.000
Erin-chan, here's your lunch.

00:08:27.000 --> 00:08:28.440
Thank you.

00:08:28.440 --> 00:08:32.970
Today's lunch is cold vegetable soup and pako.

00:08:32.970 --> 00:08:36.410
Karisa-san said we can eat with you.

00:08:44.790 --> 00:08:46.200
Itadakimasu.

00:08:47.180 --> 00:08:50.210
Ittadakimasu!

00:08:50.210 --> 00:08:52.150
How's Lilan doing?

00:08:52.540 --> 00:08:55.390
Ah yes, it's doing well.

00:09:01.670 --> 00:09:03.830
This veggie soup is great!

00:09:03.830 --> 00:09:05.990
You just want to boast that you made it.

00:09:06.890 --> 00:09:07.950
You read my mind.

00:09:07.950 --> 00:09:10.440
I hate to admit it, but it does taste good!

00:09:11.400 --> 00:09:14.790
If you don't mind, I'm going back to where Lilan is.

00:09:15.950 --> 00:09:18.390
Thank you for the souvenir.

00:09:19.290 --> 00:09:21.920
That's right, gotta work hard.

00:09:25.970 --> 00:09:29.880
Was a sculpture of a beast-lord not that great?

00:09:30.340 --> 00:09:33.540
Hey.  You have to cheer her up more.

00:09:33.540 --> 00:09:34.870
Yeah!

00:09:35.540 --> 00:09:37.560
Did something happen to Erin?

00:09:37.560 --> 00:09:40.830
The man who raised her passed away.

00:09:45.190 --> 00:09:48.310
Look.  It's just like you.

00:09:53.120 --> 00:09:55.060
Hey, Lilan!

00:10:00.950 --> 00:10:03.320
Y-You ate it?

00:10:16.920 --> 00:10:18.010
What?

00:10:19.970 --> 00:10:24.080
Jeez, you made me laugh so much, I'm crying now.

00:11:00.520 --> 00:11:01.310
Erin.

00:11:06.960 --> 00:11:08.290
Tomura-senpai.

00:11:10.400 --> 00:11:13.210
I'm sorry!  Lilan bit it.

00:11:14.200 --> 00:11:15.940
Don't worry about it.

00:11:17.140 --> 00:11:21.120
Besides that, I heard about your Oji-san.

00:11:24.420 --> 00:11:26.200
I'm fine.

00:11:28.690 --> 00:11:32.270
When I'm not upbeat, Lilan gets worried.

00:11:32.740 --> 00:11:35.060
So I need to keep strong.

00:11:39.760 --> 00:11:42.480
It looks like Erin's forcing herself.

00:11:43.420 --> 00:11:47.060
You're right.  I noticed that, too.

00:11:48.010 --> 00:11:50.540
Isn't there anything we can do?

00:11:52.650 --> 00:11:54.690
I have an idea.

00:12:04.100 --> 00:12:05.050
Who is it?

00:12:05.520 --> 00:12:07.110
It's me, Erin.

00:12:08.190 --> 00:12:09.500
Esal-sensei?!

00:12:11.970 --> 00:12:14.980
Pack up right now.  We're leaving.

00:12:15.550 --> 00:12:16.960
"Leaving?"

00:12:17.190 --> 00:12:19.920
I left Tomura in charge of Lilan.

00:12:21.300 --> 00:12:22.390
Um...

00:12:22.740 --> 00:12:25.490
We'll be back by tomorrow night.

00:12:25.490 --> 00:12:26.820
There's no problem, is there?

00:12:27.430 --> 00:12:29.690
Where are we going?

00:12:31.010 --> 00:12:32.520
To see Jone.

00:13:14.700 --> 00:13:15.580
Oh dear.

00:13:17.920 --> 00:13:19.650
What a horrible inn.

00:13:20.870 --> 00:13:22.910
The walls and the bed are all run-down.

00:13:23.930 --> 00:13:26.470
I should have chosen a better place.

00:13:33.740 --> 00:13:36.590
Um, where are we going tomorrow?

00:13:37.320 --> 00:13:40.750
A secret base shared by Jone and me.

00:13:41.270 --> 00:13:43.100
"A secret base?"

00:13:51.420 --> 00:13:53.240
This is so stiff.

00:13:55.450 --> 00:13:56.860
There, finally.

00:13:59.600 --> 00:14:00.770
It has no taste.

00:14:01.120 --> 00:14:03.190
And it's cold, too.

00:14:03.190 --> 00:14:08.440
S-Still, it's refreshing to eat outside the dorm.

00:14:09.580 --> 00:14:13.100
I heard there's a really big bath here.

00:14:13.100 --> 00:14:15.890
Shall we head over after we finish eating?

00:14:19.230 --> 00:14:22.920
It stands up to its reputation.  It's a pretty nice bath.

00:14:25.380 --> 00:14:30.330
But the quality of the water's probably better at Kazalm.

00:14:32.330 --> 00:14:33.450
What's the matter?

00:14:34.670 --> 00:14:36.720
This just brings me back.

00:14:39.600 --> 00:14:43.410
The village I was born at had a bath like this, too.

00:14:46.910 --> 00:14:51.130
I used to soak in it with my mother like this often.

00:14:59.920 --> 00:15:05.740
The village I grew up in had a large bath like this, too, and we often played like this.

00:15:06.350 --> 00:15:07.540
Back when I was a child.

00:15:08.030 --> 00:15:09.430
Those were fun days.

00:15:34.070 --> 00:15:35.210
Honey?

00:15:36.120 --> 00:15:38.990
Yes.  It makes it tasty if you use it.

00:15:39.460 --> 00:15:41.800
Although, it's not Jone's honey.

00:15:42.210 --> 00:15:43.680
Here you go.

00:15:46.840 --> 00:15:48.140
It's sweet.

00:15:48.680 --> 00:15:52.630
I never would have guessed he'd become a honey man.

00:15:53.460 --> 00:15:57.280
I never imagined him as anything other than being a teacher.

00:15:58.440 --> 00:16:04.750
He would gather those who were about to fail and always tutor them.

00:16:04.750 --> 00:16:09.030
I once asked him why he went out and did such a thing.

00:16:09.550 --> 00:16:12.300
Then, he said this to me:

00:16:13.110 --> 00:16:17.860
"I enjoy finding the potential inside people."

00:16:22.230 --> 00:16:26.660
I was surprised to find a person who thinks like that.

00:16:26.660 --> 00:16:30.480
He never changed from when he was young.

00:16:31.700 --> 00:16:36.440
So, it was surprising to hear that he quit being a teacher.

00:16:37.450 --> 00:16:40.260
He really liked to teach.

00:16:42.490 --> 00:16:47.950
I was a researcher, but a transfer to Kazalm came up.

00:16:47.950 --> 00:16:51.020
That's when I remembered Jone's words, and...

00:16:52.140 --> 00:16:56.380
I felt like a job that searches for potential wasn't so bad.

00:16:57.520 --> 00:17:02.840
If it weren't for Jone, I probably wouldn't be here with you.

00:17:05.050 --> 00:17:07.050
If it weren't for Oji-san...

00:17:10.330 --> 00:17:14.210
He saved me, not knowing where I came from...

00:17:24.060 --> 00:17:25.900
He raised me...

00:17:32.100 --> 00:17:34.200
He taught me...

00:17:44.590 --> 00:17:47.740
I wanted to thank him properly some day...

00:17:47.740 --> 00:17:51.830
Yet, I couldn't give anything back to him.

00:17:53.190 --> 00:17:57.690
All you have to do is pursue your path.

00:17:58.850 --> 00:18:01.300
He was...  Jone was...

00:18:01.850 --> 00:18:07.170
He must have been able to live his way because you were there.

00:18:14.170 --> 00:18:15.080
Erin.

00:18:30.400 --> 00:18:36.450
Esal-sensei, please tell me more about Oji-san when he was a student.

00:18:37.760 --> 00:18:39.090
Let's see.

00:18:39.610 --> 00:18:40.860
He was a bookworm.

00:18:40.860 --> 00:18:46.660
He would often sleep during class from staying up all night, reading.

00:18:47.090 --> 00:18:48.810
Really?

00:18:48.810 --> 00:18:55.910
He would also sneak out of class and study what he wanted to at his secret base.

00:18:56.260 --> 00:18:58.280
"Secret base?"

00:18:58.730 --> 00:19:02.750
It's a hut in the middle of a beautiful field with flowers.

00:19:03.360 --> 00:19:05.640
It was our favorite place.

00:19:06.190 --> 00:19:07.890
Really?

00:19:08.620 --> 00:19:13.150
He used to be thin when he was young and was pretty handsome.

00:19:13.520 --> 00:19:17.360
When I first met him, I thought he was a bear.

00:19:18.070 --> 00:19:19.020
A bear...

00:19:22.720 --> 00:19:27.140
But eventually, he started to fart regardless of where he was.

00:19:27.140 --> 00:19:29.460
Honestly, what was the deal with that?

00:20:00.680 --> 00:20:02.240
This is...

00:20:02.240 --> 00:20:05.050
The secret base I told you about yesterday.

00:20:06.530 --> 00:20:09.340
It's a place of memories between Jone and myself.

00:20:09.910 --> 00:20:12.270
We often studied for exams here.

00:20:14.300 --> 00:20:16.180
Oji-san would study here?

00:20:20.530 --> 00:20:24.070
Truly, nothing has changed since.

00:20:25.050 --> 00:20:30.830
He used to say, "when we die we simply go back to the soil," but I never imagined he'd let himself be interred so easily.

00:20:32.610 --> 00:20:36.450
I had a feeling that he'd be here.

00:20:50.850 --> 00:20:58.650
Erin concluded that she should continue expanding the potential Jone had found inside her.

00:20:59.440 --> 00:21:04.340
She should live a life that wouldn't shame him.

00:21:11.710 --> 00:21:13.060
<i>Erin.</i>

00:21:41.550 --> 00:21:42.940
<i>Dad.</i>

00:21:58.150 --> 00:22:01.120
<i>Thank you, Dad.</i>

00:22:03.910 --> 00:22:05.040
Sensei!

00:22:06.440 --> 00:22:10.650
Thank you very much for bringing me here.

00:22:14.070 --> 00:22:16.580
Well then, let's head back.

00:22:17.690 --> 00:22:18.480
Yes, let's.

00:24:02.010 --> 00:24:05.830
Ever since Oji-san passed away, Erin seems to be spaced out.

00:24:06.570 --> 00:24:12.420
But she gets along with Lilan as always, almost as though they're not beast-lord and human.

00:24:12.420 --> 00:24:15.490
I hope Erin's sadness will go away just like that.

00:24:16.480 --> 00:24:20.600
Right as we wish that, this has to happen.

00:24:21.500 --> 00:24:23.190
Kemono no Souja Erin.

00:24:23.190 --> 00:24:24.780
Beast's Fang.

00:24:25.090 --> 00:24:30.070
Beast's Fang
